# Backend Rules

## Structure

- `api/` — routers only; delegate to services
- `services/` — business logic
- `repositories/` or `crud/` — database access
- `models/` — SQLAlchemy models
- `schemas/` — Pydantic request/response models
- `core/` — config, database session, dependencies

## Conventions

- API prefix: `/api/v1`
- Use enums for `job_type` and `status` — align with domain JobTypes
- Pagination on list endpoints; filter by `job_type`, `status`, search by name
- Seed the four example pipeline jobs in dev/test fixtures when appropriate

## JobType values

- `EPICOR_GD_WH_SYNC` — Epicor ? GD Warehouse
- `TXT_TO_RPT` — TXT ? RPT tables
- `RPT_TO_FABRIC` — RPT ? Fabric (Data Flow)
- `DATAFLOW_TO_LAKEHOUSE` — Data Flow ? Lake House

## Migrations

- Use Alembic; review generated SQL before applying
- Do not run `alembic upgrade` without explicit approval
